Following up on my [earlier announcement][0] that I was forking Vim, I'm happy
to announce the first release of my fork today: Vim Classic 8.3.0.

[0]: Forking-vim

I have written a release announcement for vim-classic.org, which you can read
[here][1]. Happy editing!

[1]: https://vim-classic.org/news/vim-8.3-released.html
